  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven: 55 × 5 ÷ 1 – 3 + 14 = 0 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging two signs and two numbers (not digits):\n\nOption 1) 1, 3 and '–', '÷' \n\n55 × 5 ÷ 1 – 3 + 14 = 0 ⇒ 55 × 5 - 3 ÷ 1 + 14 = 0\n\n⇒ 55 × 5 - __**3 **____**÷**____** 1**__ + 14 = 0\n\n⇒ __**55 × 5**__ - 3 + 14 = 0\n\n⇒ __**275 + 14**__ - 3 = 0\n\n⇒ __289** - 3**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 286 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 1, 5 and '+', '–'\n\n55 × 5 ÷ 1 – 3 + 14 = 0 ⇒ 55 × 1 ÷ 5 + 3 - 14 = 0\n\n⇒ 55 × **__1 ÷ 5__** + 3 - 14 = 0\n\n⇒ __**55 × 0.2**__ + 3 - 14 = 0\n\n⇒ __**11 + 3**__ - 14 = 0\n\n⇒ __**14 - 14**__ = 0\n\n⇒ **0 ****= 0 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) 5, 14 and '–', '×'\n\n55 × 5 ÷ 1 – 3 + 14 = 0 ⇒ 55 - 14 ÷ 1 × 3 + 5 = 0\n\n⇒ 55 - __**14 ÷ 1**__ × 3 + 5 = 0\n\n⇒ 55 - __**14 × 3**__ + 5 = 0\n\n⇒ __**55 + 5**__ - 42 = 0\n\n⇒ __**60 - 42**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 18 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 3, 5 and '+', '÷'\n\n55 × 5 ÷ 1 – 3 + 14 = 0 ⇒ 55 × 3 + 1 – 5 ÷ 14 = 0\n\n⇒ 55 × 3 + 1 – __**5 ÷ 14**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**55 × 3**__ + 1 – 0.35 = 0\n\n⇒ __**165 + 1**__ – 0.35 = 0\n\n⇒ __**166 – 0.35**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 165.65 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
